WEBVTT

00:00:02.770 --> 00:00:04.370
It's here, it's here, it's here!

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:05.570
At last, it's here!

00:00:05.570 --> 00:00:07.520
It's the beach!

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:10.280
T-Tatsuko jumped the gun on the key line!

00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:11.860
It's ruined! Ruined!

00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:14.990
Argh, who cares anymore? 
We're going, as planned!

00:00:14.990 --> 00:00:17.770
Hold on, I can't strip down that fast!

00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:21.660
It's the beach!

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:23.410
T-Tatsuko-chan?

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:25.720
You idiot, you took off your swimsuit, too?!

00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:27.150
Hide her, hide her!

00:00:26.350 --> 00:00:27.150
Yay!

00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:28.460
Sit still!

00:00:29.260 --> 00:00:32.010
Hey! Stop, you pervert!

00:02:02.370 --> 00:02:05.890
<b>Episode 2 
Tricolore Birthday</b>

00:02:05.970 --> 00:02:08.000
Man, what a mess.

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:11.010
We nearly had a run-in with the cops.

00:02:11.010 --> 00:02:12.960
That wasn't funny at all!

00:02:12.960 --> 00:02:16.240
Thank goodness it was Tattsun, the one 
who looks like a little kid, that stripped.

00:02:16.240 --> 00:02:17.550
I did it!

00:02:18.270 --> 00:02:20.080
Why are you smiling so brightly?

00:02:20.080 --> 00:02:22.130
I don't understand it.

00:02:22.130 --> 00:02:24.910
Good grief, you should be more careful.

00:02:24.910 --> 00:02:26.350
After all, you're a girl.

00:02:26.350 --> 00:02:28.970
There have been many 
dangerous incidents recently.

00:02:28.970 --> 00:02:29.620
Oh?

00:02:30.130 --> 00:02:31.340
Illya, Illya!

00:02:31.790 --> 00:02:33.710
I know your older brother,

00:02:33.710 --> 00:02:35.950
but who's the boy in glasses beside him?

00:02:35.950 --> 00:02:37.970
Oh, uh...

00:02:38.680 --> 00:02:42.120
I'm Ryuudou Issei. A pleasure to meet you.

00:02:42.120 --> 00:02:45.010
I thought you might be worried 
if I were the only guy.

00:02:45.010 --> 00:02:46.680
So I called in backup.

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:48.160
Well, well.

00:02:48.160 --> 00:02:49.560
Thank you very much.

00:02:49.560 --> 00:02:52.250
No, thank you.

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:58.250
And what's the relationship between you?

00:02:58.250 --> 00:02:59.450
Relationship?

00:02:59.450 --> 00:03:01.660
Th-Those eyes!

00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:06.190
Relationship? Well, we're 
just ordinary friends, right?

00:03:06.190 --> 00:03:10.370
Hmm, perhaps summing it up 
with "ordinary" is a bit terse.

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:14.760
I'm always asking Emiya for help with 
various student council tasks.

00:03:14.760 --> 00:03:17.840
I hardly know what I'd do without him.

00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:20.490
What's all this, now? 
Backhanded compliments?

00:03:20.490 --> 00:03:23.080
I only do what I can to help.

00:03:23.080 --> 00:03:26.180
You'd manage just fine without me.

00:03:26.180 --> 00:03:28.680
No, I need you around.

00:03:26.180 --> 00:03:34.900
<b>Scribble Scribble</b>

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:31.430
Without your handmade lunches, 
my motivation would be in jeopardy.

00:03:31.430 --> 00:03:32.700
That's what you meant?

00:03:32.700 --> 00:03:34.900
Well, I guess they're worth 
putting effort into, then.

00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:38.170
I could have your miso soup every day, Emiya.

00:03:38.170 --> 00:03:40.850
I don't know if I could handle every day.

00:03:42.210 --> 00:03:44.690
Thank you very much!

00:03:49.180 --> 00:03:50.500
It's the beach! The beach!

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:51.960
Wait up!

00:03:53.220 --> 00:03:54.410
Such children.

00:03:54.410 --> 00:03:56.250
Well, we are children!

00:03:58.860 --> 00:04:00.130
It's cold.

00:04:00.420 --> 00:04:01.840
Take that!

00:04:01.840 --> 00:04:02.990
You've done it now!

00:04:02.990 --> 00:04:04.130
It's cold!

00:04:04.130 --> 00:04:05.510
Here's your payback!

00:04:06.770 --> 00:04:08.360
<i>Tatsuko Strike!</i>

00:04:13.300 --> 00:04:14.440
Illya!

00:04:15.150 --> 00:04:16.190
Here, Miyu!

00:04:19.540 --> 00:04:21.490
What's wrong, Miyu?

00:04:21.850 --> 00:04:23.440
I don't know the rules.

00:04:23.440 --> 00:04:24.070
Huh?

00:04:24.280 --> 00:04:26.690
There are no rules. It's just volleyball.

00:04:26.690 --> 00:04:28.770
But there's no net, or lines...

00:04:28.770 --> 00:04:31.700
It's not that kind of game. 
We're keeping it simple.

00:04:32.940 --> 00:04:35.910
The only thing is that if the 
ball hits the water, you lose.

00:04:35.910 --> 00:04:36.920
All right.

00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:39.880
Then one more time! Suzuka!

00:04:40.270 --> 00:04:41.260
Nanaki!

00:04:41.620 --> 00:04:42.670
Miyucchi!

00:04:50.820 --> 00:04:52.310
Was that okay?

00:04:58.890 --> 00:05:00.610
This is fun!

00:05:00.610 --> 00:05:01.400
Yeah.

00:05:03.270 --> 00:05:05.150
This kind of thing is pretty nice.

00:05:07.770 --> 00:05:09.940
Miyu, where are you going?

00:05:09.940 --> 00:05:11.830
Just for a little walk.

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:15.200
I've never seen a place like this before.

00:05:16.220 --> 00:05:20.290
Okay, then I'll go with you.
What about you, Kuro?

00:05:23.400 --> 00:05:25.970
Wow, really?

00:05:26.260 --> 00:05:28.780
Yeah. This is only my second time at a beach.

00:05:28.780 --> 00:05:30.720
But it's my first time going in the water.

00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:34.090
Oh... No wonder you didn't 
know how to enjoy it.

00:05:34.090 --> 00:05:34.930
Yeah.

00:05:34.930 --> 00:05:39.480
But that's unusual for someone living 
here, with the sea near the city.

00:05:40.640 --> 00:05:43.620
Until recently, I lived abroad.

00:05:44.430 --> 00:05:47.430
When I was little, I lived in Fuyuki City with

00:05:47.430 --> 00:05:49.780
my father and brother, the three of us.

00:05:49.780 --> 00:05:54.160
But Father died of an illness, 
and I was taken in by folks abroad.

00:05:54.620 --> 00:05:57.500
I only returned to this city recently.

00:05:57.500 --> 00:05:59.880
So then, your brother...

00:06:00.570 --> 00:06:02.340
Yes, Shirou-san

00:06:02.940 --> 00:06:04.550
resembles him...

00:06:07.670 --> 00:06:09.010
I see.

00:06:11.860 --> 00:06:14.880
They say a hedge keeps friendship green,

00:06:13.840 --> 00:06:16.710
Popsicles! Who wants a popsicle?

00:06:14.880 --> 00:06:17.120
but I think there are things to gain when

00:06:17.120 --> 00:06:19.190
you work up the courage to cross them.

00:06:17.150 --> 00:06:20.970
Popsicles! Who wants a popsicle?

00:06:21.350 --> 00:06:24.660
Popsicles! Who wants a popsicle?

00:06:23.360 --> 00:06:26.040
Jeez, you're annoying!

00:06:26.780 --> 00:06:28.990
Hmm? Oh, you three...

00:06:28.990 --> 00:06:30.500
B-Bazett?

00:06:30.500 --> 00:06:32.240
You're here again, berserker woman?

00:06:31.060 --> 00:06:33.450
W-We need to trance! Ruby! Ruby!

00:06:33.950 --> 00:06:38.230
Having children react that way 
to me is a bit depressing.

00:06:38.230 --> 00:06:42.170
Relax. I have no intention of 
fighting you three here.

00:06:42.760 --> 00:06:45.130
After all, I'm now...

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:48.020
just a popsicle stand worker!

00:06:45.320 --> 00:06:48.880
<b>Gakumazawa Beach Hut</b>

00:06:49.020 --> 00:06:50.520
<i>What the heck?</i>

00:06:51.090 --> 00:06:54.470
Somehow, the bill for repairs
resulting from our recent fight

00:06:54.470 --> 00:06:57.350
passed through the Association and fell to me.

00:06:56.760 --> 00:06:59.130
She's talking about Luvia-san's house, right?

00:06:57.350 --> 00:07:00.450
My credit cards were frozen, 
and I ran out of cash.

00:06:59.130 --> 00:07:00.450
I think so...

00:07:00.450 --> 00:07:03.060
That Edelfelt girl is scary.

00:07:03.060 --> 00:07:05.900
However, that isn't a big problem.

00:07:06.290 --> 00:07:09.150
I can earn money by working day jobs.

00:07:09.150 --> 00:07:11.910
If I set my mind to it, I can 
eat grass from the roadside!

00:07:11.910 --> 00:07:14.870
<i>There's something wrong with her!</i>

00:07:14.870 --> 00:07:20.580
And so, that will be 500 yen each. 
Thank you for your business.

00:07:21.110 --> 00:07:25.020
<i>Sh-She's ripping us off!</i>

00:07:28.630 --> 00:07:32.050
Huh? Why do you look so down?

00:07:32.050 --> 00:07:35.300
Well... Some no-good woman 
forced us to buy things...

00:07:35.300 --> 00:07:36.260
Huh...

00:07:36.800 --> 00:07:39.310
Okay, ready to move on to the site?

00:07:39.310 --> 00:07:41.010
Site? Site of what?

00:07:41.010 --> 00:07:44.150
We're tired, so we were
thinking of heading home.

00:07:44.150 --> 00:07:46.780
Hey! Have you forgotten the reason for today?

00:07:46.780 --> 00:07:49.900
Remember? Today's their birthday!

00:07:49.900 --> 00:07:51.750
O-Oh...

00:07:51.750 --> 00:07:53.400
Sorry, Illyas.

00:07:53.400 --> 00:07:58.020
Since your birthday was just an excuse 
to go to the beach, I forgot.

00:07:58.020 --> 00:08:00.410
Hey, at least try to put it more nicely!

00:08:00.920 --> 00:08:02.870
A beach hut?

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:04.620
Gakumazawa?

00:08:04.620 --> 00:08:07.360
Gakumazawa? You mean...

00:08:07.360 --> 00:08:09.700
Oh, my family runs this place.

00:08:09.700 --> 00:08:12.170
What? Wasn't your home a dojo?

00:08:12.170 --> 00:08:15.280
My dad said this place earns 
more than the dojo in summer.

00:08:15.280 --> 00:08:18.060
The Gakumazawa dojo gets no gratitude!

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:19.310
Welcome!

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:24.020
<b>Oldest Son: Gakumazawa Reiichi       Second Son: Gakumazawa Gaisuke</b>

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:22.170
Oh, if it isn't Tatsuko!

00:08:22.170 --> 00:08:24.020
Hey, are those your friends?

00:08:24.020 --> 00:08:25.660
Oh, Aniki!

00:08:25.660 --> 00:08:27.520
We have a reservation under "Emiya."

00:08:27.720 --> 00:08:29.980
Her brothers appeared?!

00:08:30.010 --> 00:08:37.990
<b>Father: Gakumazawa Gouto         Mother: Gakumazawa Stella</b>

00:08:30.200 --> 00:08:32.390
Welcome. We've been waiting.

00:08:33.570 --> 00:08:35.850
What? You're Tatsuko's friends?

00:08:35.850 --> 00:08:37.990
In that case, we'll throw in a little extra!

00:08:37.990 --> 00:08:39.700
Her parents, too?!

00:08:39.700 --> 00:08:41.750
Wh-What's going on here?

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:45.170
We never wanted to meet them, 
but Tattsun's entire family is here!

00:08:45.520 --> 00:08:48.070
It's like you've become the main character!

00:08:48.070 --> 00:08:49.920
You cheeky brat!

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:51.670
What nonsense are you spouting?

00:08:52.120 --> 00:08:57.450
Everyone plays the main 
character in their own lives.

00:08:57.450 --> 00:08:59.870
When did she gain such an air of importance?

00:08:59.870 --> 00:09:01.680
Just hurry up and sit down.

00:09:02.080 --> 00:09:04.020
One, two...

00:09:04.020 --> 00:09:07.940
Illya, Kuro, Miyu! Happy Birthday!

00:09:08.890 --> 00:09:10.400
Thank you!

00:09:10.400 --> 00:09:12.700
This is kind of amazing.

00:09:12.700 --> 00:09:14.420
Shaved ice and ice cream?

00:09:14.420 --> 00:09:16.900
Since we're at the beach, I thought 
this would be better than cake,

00:09:16.900 --> 00:09:18.410
so I had them make it for us.

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:20.800
Nicely done, Gakumazawa Beach Hut!

00:09:22.060 --> 00:09:26.330
Uh, thank you all for gathering here, 
despite the heat...

00:09:26.330 --> 00:09:27.800
Illya, we don't need that.

00:09:30.100 --> 00:09:31.120
Really?

00:09:31.120 --> 00:09:32.050
Illya...

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:36.190
What do you do at a birthday party?

00:09:37.420 --> 00:09:40.680
It's a birthday party, so you 
celebrate your birthday, right?

00:09:41.150 --> 00:09:43.430
A birthday's something to celebrate?

00:09:43.430 --> 00:09:44.710
Huh?

00:09:45.570 --> 00:09:49.080
Y-You're asking an awfully 
basic question, Miyucchi...

00:09:49.080 --> 00:09:51.400
Have you never had yours celebrated before?

00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:52.230
Never.

00:09:52.230 --> 00:09:53.140
<i>Ah, crap!</i>

00:09:53.140 --> 00:09:54.610
<i>That question was a landmine!</i>

00:09:55.500 --> 00:09:58.330
Cola's great! It's the best in the world!

00:09:57.420 --> 00:09:58.330
<i>Nice, Tattsun!</i>

00:09:58.330 --> 00:10:00.070
<i>Sometimes, she's useful!</i>

00:10:01.060 --> 00:10:02.530
Well...

00:10:02.530 --> 00:10:07.310
When you have a birthday, 
you celebrate being born,

00:10:07.310 --> 00:10:12.550
thank those who bore you, and reaffirm 
the life you've lived up to now.

00:10:13.170 --> 00:10:14.970
I think it's that kind of day.

00:10:16.350 --> 00:10:20.340
Celebration, gratitude, and reaffirmation...

00:10:20.340 --> 00:10:24.010
But I don't think you need 
to worry so much about it.

00:10:24.320 --> 00:10:28.020
The one being celebrated should 
eat some good food,

00:10:28.470 --> 00:10:30.060
have fun however they like,

00:10:30.060 --> 00:10:32.310
and accept their presents.

00:10:32.770 --> 00:10:35.530
That's all you really need to do.

00:10:35.530 --> 00:10:38.140
Happy birthday, all three of you.

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:42.810
O-O-Onii-chan! Can we open them?

00:10:42.810 --> 00:10:43.780
Go ahead.

00:10:43.780 --> 00:10:45.130
Yay!

00:10:52.880 --> 00:10:55.130
Is this a bracelet?

00:10:55.130 --> 00:10:59.010
It's cute! I love it!

00:10:59.010 --> 00:11:00.970
Glad to hear it.

00:11:01.190 --> 00:11:03.030
Thank you, Onii-chan!

00:11:03.030 --> 00:11:04.680
I'll treasure it.

00:11:04.680 --> 00:11:06.100
Come on, Miyu. You, too!

00:11:09.670 --> 00:11:11.310
For being born,

00:11:11.310 --> 00:11:13.770
for being alive until today,

00:11:13.770 --> 00:11:15.760
for meeting Illya,

00:11:16.260 --> 00:11:18.190
for meeting everyone else,

00:11:18.190 --> 00:11:20.160
for meeting Shirou-san...

00:11:20.890 --> 00:11:23.560
I'm grateful for all of that.

00:11:24.040 --> 00:11:25.620
Thank you.

00:11:26.240 --> 00:11:28.350
Th-That's heavy!

00:11:28.350 --> 00:11:30.870
Your words of gratitude are too heavy!

00:11:30.870 --> 00:11:32.990
It's like you were giving a wedding speech!

00:11:32.990 --> 00:11:36.550
In that case, accept our presents, too! Here!

00:11:36.550 --> 00:11:38.260
Be grateful!

00:11:39.370 --> 00:11:41.770
There's no way we can wear those!

00:11:41.770 --> 00:11:43.930
What? But our feelings!

00:11:43.930 --> 00:11:47.060
Didn't you forget our birthday in the first place?

00:11:47.920 --> 00:11:49.590
Stop complaining and put them on!

00:11:49.590 --> 00:11:51.250
You can't be serious!

00:11:52.400 --> 00:11:53.830
That's loud!

00:11:53.830 --> 00:11:54.980
What was that?

00:11:56.560 --> 00:11:57.690
What's going on?

00:11:58.820 --> 00:12:01.250
Construction? Out here?

00:12:03.830 --> 00:12:05.120
My, if it isn't Illya.

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:06.450
Huh? Oh...

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:08.410
Tohsaka and Luvia?

00:12:06.970 --> 00:12:10.040
Popsicles! Who wants a popsicle?

00:12:08.410 --> 00:12:10.040
What are you doing here?

00:12:10.460 --> 00:12:11.260
Popsic—

00:12:12.790 --> 00:12:16.720
<i>What's with this chaotic grouping?</i>

00:12:21.180 --> 00:12:23.680
What a coincidence meeting you here.

00:12:23.680 --> 00:12:24.940
Bazett!

00:12:24.940 --> 00:12:26.720
What's the meaning of that outfit?

00:12:26.720 --> 00:12:28.390
What's this about?

00:12:28.390 --> 00:12:29.350
Someone you know?

00:12:29.710 --> 00:12:33.070
She really does appear out of 
the blue. What should we do?

00:12:33.070 --> 00:12:34.470
Settle down.

00:12:34.470 --> 00:12:37.320
You're not foolish enough to 
cause a scene here, are you?

00:12:37.320 --> 00:12:39.360
Not in front of so many people...

00:12:39.680 --> 00:12:41.230
Not in front of Shero!

00:12:41.230 --> 00:12:42.650
I mean, Shero!

00:12:42.650 --> 00:12:44.780
Shero, Shero!

00:12:43.000 --> 00:12:44.780
Shut up with the "Shero, Shero"!

00:12:44.780 --> 00:12:47.540
What are you two doing here?

00:12:47.540 --> 00:12:49.240
I can't imagine it's true, but...

00:12:49.240 --> 00:12:52.360
Are you involved with this 
suspicious construction?

00:12:54.670 --> 00:12:55.870
Of course not!

00:12:56.360 --> 00:12:57.330
Hmm...

00:12:57.700 --> 00:13:02.040
Then why is the contractor listed as "Edelfelt"?

00:13:02.480 --> 00:13:05.130
<i>Tsk! This man's sharp!</i>

00:13:05.130 --> 00:13:07.340
<i>He's like a pesky in-law!</i>

00:13:07.340 --> 00:13:08.870
Hey, Miyu?

00:13:08.870 --> 00:13:09.860
Is this...

00:13:09.860 --> 00:13:12.110
Yeah. It's related to the eighth Card.

00:13:12.110 --> 00:13:15.090
It's deep underground, 
so they're digging a tunnel to it.

00:13:15.090 --> 00:13:16.510
I see.

00:13:16.510 --> 00:13:19.060
So that's why we couldn't retrieve it right away.

00:13:21.100 --> 00:13:22.030
Oh?

00:13:22.030 --> 00:13:24.140
There you are, Illyas!

00:13:24.140 --> 00:13:25.870
What's this construction?

00:13:25.870 --> 00:13:28.330
Whoa! That's a huge work truck!

00:13:28.330 --> 00:13:29.700
Tatsuko-chan, that's dangerous.

00:13:30.600 --> 00:13:33.380
What do we do? Everyone's here.

00:13:33.380 --> 00:13:36.690
Let's withdraw before this situation 
grows any more complicated.

00:13:36.690 --> 00:13:37.460
Yeah.

00:13:37.890 --> 00:13:40.340
I-It's nothing.

00:13:40.340 --> 00:13:43.520
Come on, it's dangerous over here. 
Let's play over there.

00:13:43.520 --> 00:13:44.440
Huh?

00:13:44.440 --> 00:13:46.800
Ah! Blonde ringlets and pigtails!

00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:47.440
Huh?

00:13:47.440 --> 00:13:48.760
What is it?

00:13:49.010 --> 00:13:50.840
What, you know them?

00:13:50.840 --> 00:13:59.340
Those... Those are the devils who ruined 
my sister, Moriyama Nanami's, love life!

00:13:59.340 --> 00:14:01.190
Wh-What?!

00:14:01.190 --> 00:14:02.730
You must be mistaken.

00:14:02.730 --> 00:14:05.510
We would never interfere in another's...

00:14:05.510 --> 00:14:11.080
No, hold on. Moriyama, Moriyama... 
That rings a bell...

00:14:14.320 --> 00:14:17.760
You mean the Moriyama who 
got covered in frogs!

00:14:17.760 --> 00:14:19.550
That Moriyama!

00:14:19.550 --> 00:14:21.420
What kind of situation is this?

00:14:21.420 --> 00:14:22.890
I heard about that!

00:14:22.890 --> 00:14:25.310
There was a terrible incident where two female students were

00:14:25.310 --> 00:14:27.880
throwing bags of dissection frogs at each other!

00:14:27.880 --> 00:14:29.130
How do you know that?

00:14:29.130 --> 00:14:32.820
Ever since then, my sister's had a frog phobia!

00:14:32.820 --> 00:14:35.850
For someone with the character for 
"snake" in her name, it's tragic!

00:14:34.120 --> 00:14:35.850
<b>Moriyama Nanami (snake)</b>

00:14:35.850 --> 00:14:38.740
That's right! Handling the aftermath was terrible!

00:14:38.740 --> 00:14:40.770
What were you two thinking?

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:44.090
We couldn't help it! We didn't 
know the frogs were in there!

00:14:44.090 --> 00:14:46.990
That doesn't mean you should have 
thrown them at Moriyama!

00:14:46.990 --> 00:14:50.820
You're taking that woman's side, 
Shero? Are you, Shero?

00:14:48.850 --> 00:14:50.820
Is this turning into a battlefield?

00:14:50.820 --> 00:14:53.440
Hey, do something about this, Illya!

00:14:53.440 --> 00:14:55.150
Why are you saying that to me?

00:14:55.150 --> 00:14:56.280
Why? Because

00:14:56.280 --> 00:15:00.030
this is a dispute between 
groups that revolve around you!

00:15:00.030 --> 00:15:02.330
But I'm not directly involved, so why me?

00:15:02.330 --> 00:15:04.300
First of all, that girl was at fault

00:15:04.300 --> 00:15:06.960
in the first place for making
an obvious pass at Emiya-kun!

00:15:06.960 --> 00:15:09.150
Don't badmouth my sister!

00:15:09.150 --> 00:15:10.700
At Emiya-kun?

00:15:10.700 --> 00:15:13.360
Meaning the person Nanami-san loves is...

00:15:13.360 --> 00:15:14.720
Illya's brother?

00:15:14.720 --> 00:15:15.610
Huh?

00:15:16.540 --> 00:15:17.680
What?

00:15:16.900 --> 00:15:19.560
My future sister-in-law!

00:15:18.000 --> 00:15:20.980
No! Don't drag me into this!

00:15:20.980 --> 00:15:22.360
How cowardly!

00:15:22.360 --> 00:15:25.590
Your strategy is to win over 
the little sister first, then?

00:15:25.590 --> 00:15:26.980
But that's futile!

00:15:27.420 --> 00:15:31.180
Illyasviel has already sworn 
a vow of sisterhood with me!

00:15:31.180 --> 00:15:32.360
I have not!

00:15:32.360 --> 00:15:35.660
It doesn't involve Emiya-kun, but Illya and I

00:15:35.660 --> 00:15:38.900
already share a confidential relationship.

00:15:38.900 --> 00:15:41.250
You're saying things that will create 
more misunderstandings!

00:15:41.250 --> 00:15:45.520
Well, I happen to know that Illya has 
a mole in an embarrassing spot!

00:15:45.520 --> 00:15:47.170
How do you know that?!

00:15:47.170 --> 00:15:50.520
Sheesh! After listening to you 
guys, you're all shameless!

00:15:50.520 --> 00:15:53.010
I knew I couldn't entrust Emiya to a woman!

00:15:53.010 --> 00:15:55.570
We'll see to him at the men-only Ryuudou Temple!

00:15:55.570 --> 00:15:57.680
That only creates different worries!

00:15:58.130 --> 00:16:00.820
Popsicles! Who wants a popsicle?!

00:16:00.820 --> 00:16:02.020
You're still here?

00:16:02.020 --> 00:16:03.910
Now, what will you do?

00:16:03.910 --> 00:16:05.430
Well, Illya?

00:16:05.430 --> 00:16:07.800
Huh? No, ah...

00:16:05.430 --> 00:16:07.800
Whose side are you on?

00:16:07.800 --> 00:16:08.680
Emiya!

00:16:08.680 --> 00:16:09.870
Illyasviel!

00:16:09.870 --> 00:16:10.750
Illya!

00:16:10.750 --> 00:16:11.600
Illya!

00:16:11.600 --> 00:16:12.350
Popsicles!

00:16:12.350 --> 00:16:13.010
Emiya!

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:18.910
She ran!

00:16:20.150 --> 00:16:22.250
Who wants a popsicle?!

00:16:20.150 --> 00:16:22.250
Wait, Illya!

00:16:22.250 --> 00:16:24.120
No! Don't follow me!

00:16:24.120 --> 00:16:26.940
You have a bad habit of running 
when things get bad!

00:16:26.940 --> 00:16:28.130
That's right, that's right!

00:16:28.130 --> 00:16:30.080
You're all just saying whatever you want!

00:16:30.080 --> 00:16:32.230
How am I supposed to keep it all under control?

00:16:32.230 --> 00:16:36.290
For starters, Onii-chan... Onii-chan is my...

00:16:37.220 --> 00:16:39.430
Illya...

00:16:39.430 --> 00:16:40.640
-san!

00:16:40.640 --> 00:16:44.010
Ow! R-Ruby? Where have you been?

00:16:44.010 --> 00:16:46.420
It's finished! It's finished, Illya-san!

00:16:46.420 --> 00:16:49.110
What's finished? 
Wait, this isn't the time for that!

00:16:49.560 --> 00:16:54.210
My heart ached all night to see the rivals 
for your love continue to multiply...

00:16:54.210 --> 00:16:57.470
So after much refining, it's finally done!

00:16:57.470 --> 00:17:00.080
Ruby-chan's special love potion!

00:17:00.530 --> 00:17:04.050
<i>Ah, she's brought something even 
more troublesome into the mix...</i>

00:17:04.500 --> 00:17:09.210
Sorry, but I'm getting nothing but bad vibes 
from this, so throw the potion away.

00:17:07.510 --> 00:17:08.620
There!

00:17:11.140 --> 00:17:12.180
Emiya-kun?

00:17:12.180 --> 00:17:13.320
Shero?

00:17:14.090 --> 00:17:15.710
He went down face-first!

00:17:15.710 --> 00:17:18.240
Like a puppet whose strings were cut!

00:17:18.990 --> 00:17:20.600
There's no going back now!

00:17:21.000 --> 00:17:25.100
Now, hurry! Shirou-san will fall in 
love with the first person he sees!

00:17:25.890 --> 00:17:28.110
You're toying with people's feelings!

00:17:28.110 --> 00:17:29.930
Snap out of it, Shero!

00:17:33.490 --> 00:17:34.810
Luvia?

00:17:34.810 --> 00:17:37.260
That's right! It's okay, Shero!

00:17:39.170 --> 00:17:40.530
Luvia...

00:17:40.920 --> 00:17:42.770
Your breasts are really big.

00:17:45.800 --> 00:17:47.970
It's an assault of pure mass.

00:17:47.970 --> 00:17:52.000
I try not to look, but my eyes are drawn to their

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:54.470
overwhelming presence near your face.

00:17:55.010 --> 00:17:57.660
Even when I try to forget 
how they feel when carelessly

00:17:57.660 --> 00:18:00.720
pressed against me, it's already 
etched into my memory.

00:18:00.720 --> 00:18:04.340
Wh-Wh-What are you saying, Shero?!

00:18:04.340 --> 00:18:05.320
Ow!

00:18:05.810 --> 00:18:06.890
Tohsaka...

00:18:07.200 --> 00:18:08.650
Tohsaka, you

00:18:08.650 --> 00:18:10.600
stick out your legs too far.

00:18:10.600 --> 00:18:13.810
I'm guessing you keep your skirt short 
because you lack confidence in your chest.

00:18:13.810 --> 00:18:16.770
But that length isn't enough to cover yourself,

00:18:16.770 --> 00:18:18.980
so occasionally the cloth beneath peeks out.

00:18:18.980 --> 00:18:21.050
The line between thigh and buttock has a

00:18:21.050 --> 00:18:23.620
beauty and eroticism hard to describe.

00:18:23.620 --> 00:18:26.970
What the heck?! What's going on with him?!

00:18:25.100 --> 00:18:26.970
What's happened to you, Onii-chan?

00:18:26.970 --> 00:18:28.960
Shirou-san... I can't believe he'd...

00:18:29.310 --> 00:18:31.010
What's going on, Ruby?

00:18:31.010 --> 00:18:33.230
Hmm, seems I made a mistake and injected him

00:18:33.230 --> 00:18:35.340
with the truth serum I always keep handy.

00:18:35.340 --> 00:18:36.580
Ruby?!

00:18:36.580 --> 00:18:38.340
Issei, sometimes your eyes are scary.

00:18:38.340 --> 00:18:39.420
What?!

00:18:39.420 --> 00:18:41.820
Elementary schoolers these 
days are so well-developed...

00:18:41.820 --> 00:18:44.560
He's turning his attention on us now?!

00:18:44.560 --> 00:18:47.250
No more! Someone do something!

00:18:47.490 --> 00:18:48.690
Let's!

00:18:52.040 --> 00:18:53.980
Wh-What's going on?

00:18:55.040 --> 00:18:57.080
What did you do this time, Ruby?

00:18:57.080 --> 00:18:59.490
I injected a powerful sedative.

00:18:59.490 --> 00:19:02.930
They'll be in nirvana for a while, 
so everything will be quiet.

00:19:02.930 --> 00:19:04.450
Is this safe?!

00:19:05.240 --> 00:19:09.120
Now, the preparations are finally in place.

00:19:09.120 --> 00:19:10.870
<i>The love potion?</i>

00:19:11.240 --> 00:19:14.840
There's no one else around. Go on...

00:19:14.840 --> 00:19:17.430
Enjoy your romantic moment!

00:19:17.430 --> 00:19:19.800
Where's the romance in this scene?

00:19:20.080 --> 00:19:23.550
Onii-chan, hold on! Come back to your senses!

00:19:31.230 --> 00:19:32.650
Onii-chan?

00:19:33.400 --> 00:19:34.570
<i>No way...</i>

00:19:37.580 --> 00:19:41.740
<i>Here? Like this? No!</i>

00:19:42.340 --> 00:19:44.460
<i>No, not this!</i>

00:19:49.660 --> 00:19:52.620
Ah! I forgot about her because 
she doesn't stand out!

00:19:52.620 --> 00:19:55.430
I-Illya-chan, Kuro-chan wasn't enough?

00:19:55.430 --> 00:19:58.310
You and your brother... are like that, too...

00:19:58.310 --> 00:20:00.510
Just like that time... No way!

00:20:00.510 --> 00:20:03.490
No... No!

00:20:03.490 --> 00:20:06.810
We made a mistake on the final move...

00:20:06.810 --> 00:20:11.970
Well, I'm satisfied since I got to enjoy 
all kinds of reactions from Illya-san!

00:20:11.970 --> 00:20:13.010
Nee-san...

00:20:13.820 --> 00:20:15.020
Sapphire-chan?

00:20:15.020 --> 00:20:16.820
This time, you've gone too far.

00:20:16.820 --> 00:20:21.470
Huh? But teasing my master is what I live for!

00:20:21.470 --> 00:20:25.090
Oh, well. I'll handle Illya-sama's care...

00:20:25.090 --> 00:20:29.330
And your punishment, Nee-san.

00:20:29.330 --> 00:20:32.320
No... Don't...

00:20:40.890 --> 00:20:42.670
I'm beat.

00:20:42.670 --> 00:20:44.140
Did you play a little too much?

00:20:44.140 --> 00:20:46.640
Man, for a while there, I was worried.

00:20:46.860 --> 00:20:49.570
Hmm? What exactly happened?

00:20:49.570 --> 00:20:50.930
What do you mean?

00:20:50.930 --> 00:20:54.100
Today was a pleasant day, from start to finish.

00:20:54.100 --> 00:20:55.600
It really was!

00:20:55.600 --> 00:20:58.950
Some of my memories feel vague, though.

00:20:59.610 --> 00:21:02.360
You probably played too hard and forgot them.

00:21:02.360 --> 00:21:05.530
<b>Gakumazawa Beach Hut</b>

00:21:03.050 --> 00:21:05.530
What? You didn't sell out?

00:21:05.530 --> 00:21:07.720
M-My apologies.

00:21:07.720 --> 00:21:09.490
You'd better not be slacking off!

00:21:09.490 --> 00:21:13.230
No! I'm missing about two 
hours' worth of memories,

00:21:13.230 --> 00:21:14.870
but I most certainly didn't slack off!

00:21:14.870 --> 00:21:16.520
Then you did slack off!

00:21:16.520 --> 00:21:17.210
Huh?

00:21:17.470 --> 00:21:20.830
No good, no good! I'm cutting your rate!

00:21:20.830 --> 00:21:24.180
What? No way!

00:21:24.690 --> 00:21:27.220
Hmm, well, still...

00:21:27.220 --> 00:21:30.740
I had fun today. How about you, Miyu?

00:21:30.740 --> 00:21:31.500
Me, too.

00:21:31.500 --> 00:21:32.830
Hey!

00:21:32.830 --> 00:21:34.530
Illya! Miyu!

00:21:34.530 --> 00:21:35.860
The bus is here!

00:21:35.860 --> 00:21:37.080
Hurry!

00:21:37.080 --> 00:21:39.650
Sorry! We're coming!

00:21:41.090 --> 00:21:42.610
Let's go, Miyu!

00:21:45.420 --> 00:21:46.950
<i>I had fun,</i>

00:21:47.800 --> 00:21:49.380
<i>as well.</i>

00:23:20.980 --> 00:23:23.200
Hey, what's going on?

00:23:20.980 --> 00:23:36.200
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:23.200 --> 00:23:24.700
What are you yelling about?

00:23:24.700 --> 00:23:27.490
Why is the baseball club the only 
one to have funding cuts?

00:23:27.490 --> 00:23:30.230
Are you trying to harass us?

00:23:30.230 --> 00:23:32.930
Considering your results so far, it's only natural.

00:23:32.930 --> 00:23:36.200
Besides, your summer is already over.

00:23:32.990 --> 00:23:36.200
<b>Girls, Life Is Short, so Rot Away</b>
